{"seq":1,"slug":"animation-to-ragdoll","title":"动画到物理过渡：藏起那道接缝","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ragdoll-physics/blending/animation-to-ragdoll","wordCount":1512,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"动画到物理过渡-藏起那道接缝\">动画到物理过渡：藏起那道接缝</h1><p>让角色瘫倒只需一行代码：enable simulation。但如果就这么直接切，玩家会看到角色像被瞬间抽掉骨头——上一帧还在坚挺地播放待机动画，下一帧突然全身一垮。真正的功夫全在这道从&quot;动画驱动&quot;到&quot;物理驱动&quot;的接缝上：它必须在零点几秒里悄无声息地完成，让玩家只觉得角色自然地倒了下去。本篇讲的就是这道缝的两个方向——淡入物理、以及命中反应后淡回动画。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>动画到物理的过渡，难点从来不是让角色瘫软，而是藏起那道从&quot;动画驱动&quot;切到&quot;物理驱动&quot;的接缝。做法归结为三件事：触发瞬间完整拷贝姿势与速度、用随时间爬升的混合权重让两套姿势平滑插值、以及对受击这类场景只切上身的部分布娃娃。本篇把这三件事及其反向的淡回讲清。</p>\n<h2 id=\"交接的第一步-状态拷贝\">交接的第一步：状态拷贝</h2><p>在打开物理的那一刻，物理骨架必须无缝接过动画留下的状态，否则会从一个错误的初始条件开始求解，导致跳变或炸飞。交接要完整拷贝两样东西：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>姿势</strong>：把动画当前帧每根骨骼的世界变换，写进对应刚体的位置与朝向。若只拷位置不拷朝向，胶囊会以错误的初始旋转开始碰撞。</li>\n<li><strong>速度</strong>：把每个骨段的线速度与角速度也传给刚体。这一步最常被漏——一个正在奔跑中被击倒的角色，如果速度归零，会原地软倒而不是顺着惯性向前扑。速度可由动画在相邻两帧的骨骼位移估算：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v} \\approx (\\vec{x}_t - \\vec{x}_{t-\\Delta t}) / \\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>拷贝完成后，物理骨架的初始状态与动画完全一致，此刻切换在几何上是连续的。但仅仅几何连续还不够平滑，因为物理会立刻开始按自己的规律演化，与观众预期的&quot;动画惯性&quot;之间仍可能有可感的突变。这就需要混合权重。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合权重-让两套姿势叠加\">混合权重：让两套姿势叠加</h2><p>平滑过渡的核心是一个随时间变化的<strong>物理混合权重</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。最终写回渲染骨骼的姿势，是动画姿势与物理姿势按权重的插值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>pose</mtext><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>pose</mtext><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>pose</mtext><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pose}_{final} = (1-\\alpha)\\cdot \\text{pose}_{anim} + \\alpha \\cdot \\text{pose}_{physics}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8108em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pose</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ina</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pose</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">anim</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8108em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pose</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cs</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中骨骼旋转用球面插值（slerp）、位置用线性插值。触发布娃娃时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 在 0.1–0.3 秒内从 0 爬到 1，角色便从纯动画平滑过渡到纯物理。业界经验（如多份 UE5 教程所载）常用 0.2 秒作为默认淡入时长，太短仍显生硬、太长则角色&quot;半死不活&quot;地飘一会儿。</p>\n<p>反向的淡出（从物理回到动画）用同样的机制，只是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 从 1 降回 0，这正是 <a href=\"get-up-recovery\">起身与恢复</a> 与受击反应恢复所依赖的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[受击/死亡触发] --&gt; B[拷贝动画姿势+速度&lt;br/&gt;到物理骨架]&#10;  B --&gt; C[启用物理模拟]&#10;  C --&gt; D[每帧: alpha 从 0 爬向 1]&#10;  D --&gt; E[slerp 混合&lt;br/&gt;anim 与 physics 姿势]&#10;  E --&gt; F[写回渲染骨骼]&#10;  F --&gt; G{alpha 到 1?}&#10;  G --&gt;|否| D&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[纯物理布娃娃]\">flowchart TD\n  A[受击/死亡触发] --&gt; B[拷贝动画姿势+速度&lt;br/&gt;到物理骨架]\n  B --&gt; C[启用物理模拟]\n  C --&gt; D[每帧: alpha 从 0 爬向 1]\n  D --&gt; E[slerp 混合&lt;br/&gt;anim 与 physics 姿势]\n  E --&gt; F[写回渲染骨骼]\n  F --&gt; G{alpha 到 1?}\n  G --&gt;|否| D\n  G --&gt;|是| H[纯物理布娃娃]</pre><h2 id=\"部分布娃娃-只切上半身\">部分布娃娃：只切上半身</h2><p>死亡需要全身过渡，但受击反应往往只需要局部。回顾 <a href=\"../foundations/ragdoll-types\">类型谱系</a> 里的混合布娃娃：中弹的敌人应该上身一顿后仰、下身继续跑动。实现上，把骨架按骨骼分区——从脊柱某节往上的子树进入物理、其余继续动画——并在<strong>交界骨骼</strong>处做权重过渡，避免上下身在腰部出现折线。</p>\n<p>分区的物理部分通常还需要一点弱马达（见 <a href=\"../simulation/joint-limits-motors\">关节限制与马达</a>），把上身往&quot;跑动动画本该有的姿势&quot;轻轻拉，这样受击的物理扰动叠加在动画基线上，既有真实的一顿，又不会软塌成一坨。命中的冲量施加在被击中的具体刚体上（胸口中弹就推胸口刚体），部位不同、反应不同，这份可信度是纯动画受击难以企及的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种触发场景的参数差异\">三种触发场景的参数差异</h2><p>不同场景对过渡的要求不同，下表给出实用参数区间：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>淡入 α 时长</th>\n<th>身体范围</th>\n<th>淡出/恢复</th>\n<th>要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>死亡瘫倒</td>\n<td>0.1–0.2s</td>\n<td>全身</td>\n<td>不恢复</td>\n<td>务必传速度，顺惯性倒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受击反应</td>\n<td>0.05–0.1s</td>\n<td>上身子树</td>\n<td>0.2–0.4s 淡回</td>\n<td>弱马达撑住上身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>被击飞/爆炸</td>\n<td>0.05s</td>\n<td>全身</td>\n<td>可接起身</td>\n<td>大冲量+可能需 CCD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绊倒挣扎</td>\n<td>渐进</td>\n<td>全身</td>\n<td>主动布娃娃维持</td>\n<td>交给马达持续驱动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>命中反应恢复得越快越好，否则角色一直&quot;半瘫&quot;会严重影响战斗节奏；而绊倒挣扎则不该淡回，应交给 <a href=\"powered-ragdoll\">主动布娃娃</a> 持续驱动。至于&quot;被击飞多远、硬直多久&quot;这些数值，属于 <a href=\"../../combat-system-design/hit-resolution/hit-reactions-hitstun\">战斗系统设计</a>，布娃娃只负责把它们渲染成可信的物理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>直接切换物理会让角色像被抽掉骨头，平滑过渡的功夫全在这道接缝上，目标是零点几秒内不可察觉地完成。</li>\n<li>交接第一步是完整拷贝姿势与速度到物理骨架，漏拷速度会让奔跑中倒下的角色原地软倒而非顺惯性前扑。</li>\n<li>用随时间变化的混合权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 对动画与物理姿势做 slerp 插值，淡入约 0.1–0.3 秒（常用 0.2s），反向淡出机制相同。</li>\n<li>部分布娃娃只把上身子树切给物理并在交界骨骼过渡，配弱马达撑住，是受击反应的主流做法。</li>\n<li>不同场景（死亡/受击/击飞/绊倒）的淡入时长、身体范围、是否恢复各异，击飞硬直数值由战斗系统决定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>用马达持续驱动的进阶形态：<a href=\"powered-ragdoll\">主动布娃娃</a></li>\n<li>倒地后如何淡回动画站起：<a href=\"get-up-recovery\">起身与恢复</a></li>\n<li>撑住上身所需的弱马达机制：<a href=\"../simulation/joint-limits-motors\">关节限制与马达</a></li>\n<li>动画状态机与混合树（跨库）：<a href=\"../../game-animation-systems/playback-blending/blend-trees\">游戏动画系统 · 混合树</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动画到物理过渡：藏起那道接缝","id":"动画到物理过渡-藏起那道接缝"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"交接的第一步：状态拷贝","id":"交接的第一步-状态拷贝"},{"level":2,"text":"混合权重：让两套姿势叠加","id":"混合权重-让两套姿势叠加"},{"level":2,"text":"部分布娃娃：只切上半身","id":"部分布娃娃-只切上半身"},{"level":2,"text":"三种触发场景的参数差异","id":"三种触发场景的参数差异"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"碰撞与自碰撞：既要相邻不打架，又要肢体不穿身","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ragdoll-physics/simulation/collision-self"},"next":{"title":"主动布娃娃：既活在物理里，又想保持姿势","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ragdoll-physics/blending/powered-ragdoll"}}